{"case_id":"pierqa-signal-confirm-01","question":"作者如何划分 8 份内部文档来制作训练集和测试集？测试集问题是如何生成的，共有多少组问答？","source_pages":{"2025.arxiv.2506.18027.pdf":[6]},"required_facts":["8 private internal documents","6 of them for finetuning","remaining documents for testing","manually prompting GPT-4o","specific contexts","100 question-answer pairs"],"required_fact_aliases":{"8 private internal documents":["8 份内部文档"],"6 of them for finetuning":["6 份用于微调"],"remaining documents for testing":["其余用于测试","rest for testing"],"manually prompting GPT-4o":["人工提示 GPT-4o"],"specific contexts":["特定上下文"],"100 question-answer pairs":["100 组问答","100 QA pairs"]},"expected":"数据集由 8 份内部文档组成，其中 6 份用于微调，其余用于测试。作者人工提示 GPT-4o 基于测试文档中的特定上下文生成测试题，共得到 100 组问答。","cohort_role":"prewritten_confirmation","status":"frozen_before_retrieval"}
{"case_id":"pierqa-signal-confirm-02","question":"RAG-Aware 微调时，作者如何从训练文档构造 QA 样本和检索上下文？请说明原始切块大小、QA 生成方式、QA 对数量，以及最终上下文中相关块和其他文档块的数量。","source_pages":{"2025.arxiv.2506.18027.pdf":[6]},"required_facts":["5000-character chunks","GPT-4 generates questions","detailed answers based on the question and context","approximately 2000 question-answer pairs","five 1000-character chunks from the original context","five 1000-character chunks from other documents"],"required_fact_aliases":{"5000-character chunks":["5000 字符块"],"GPT-4 generates questions":["GPT-4 生成问题"],"detailed answers based on the question and context":["根据问题和上下文生成详细答案"],"approximately 2000 question-answer pairs":["约 2000 组问答","approximately 2000 QA pairs"],"five 1000-character chunks from the original context":["原上下文的 5 个 1000 字符块"],"five 1000-character chunks from other documents":["其他文档的 5 个 1000 字符块"]},"expected":"训练文档先切成 5000 字符块；GPT-4 为各块生成问题，并结合对应上下文生成详细答案，得到约 2000 组 QA。为模拟检索，将原上下文切成 5 个 1000 字符块，并随机混入另外 5 个来自其他文档的 1000 字符块。","cohort_role":"prewritten_confirmation","status":"frozen_before_retrieval"}
{"case_id":"pierqa-signal-confirm-03","question":"附录中 DBSCAN 的 min_samples 如何按 PDF 页数设置？eps 取值是多少，作者选择这些参数的依据是什么？","source_pages":{"2025.arxiv.2506.18027.pdf":[12]},"required_facts":["6 or fewer pages min_samples 2","7 to 8 pages min_samples 3","more than 8 pages min_samples 4","eps 0.01","empirical analysis","balance precision and recall"],"required_fact_aliases":{"6 or fewer pages min_samples 2":["≤6 页时 min_samples=2","6 pages or fewer"],"7 to 8 pages min_samples 3":["7–8 页时 min_samples=3","7-8 pages"],"more than 8 pages min_samples 4":[">8 页时 min_samples=4"],"eps 0.01":["eps=0.01","0.01"],"empirical analysis":["经验分析"],"balance precision and recall":["平衡精确率和召回率"]},"expected":"文档不超过 6 页时 min_samples=2，7–8 页时为 3，超过 8 页时为 4；eps=0.01。这些值根据经验分析选择，目的是平衡页眉页脚移除的精确率和召回率。","cohort_role":"prewritten_confirmation","status":"frozen_before_retrieval"}
